shop-name-medicalntf = Combat Medic Kit
shop-desc-medicalntf = A crate containing tactical body armor, a medical bag, pouches for medical supplies and ammunition, a medical-security visor, as well as a tactical medical belt stocked with standard medications and a defibrillator.
