shop-desc-medicalscoutntf = A crate containing light tactical body armor, a medical bag, pouches for medical supplies and ammunition, a medical-security visor, as well as a tactical medical belt stocked with standard medications and a defibrillator. shop-name-armorscoutntf = Light Armor Kit
shop-desc-armorscoutntf = A crate containing a light tactical vest, a tactical bag, 1 ammo pouch, 1 general-purpose pouch, and a general tactical belt for carrying various gear.
