shop-name-armorhdmed = Combat Medic Kit
shop-desc-armorhdmed = A crate containing body armor, a gas mask, a balaclava, a medical bag, medical and ammo pouches, a medical-security visor, and a tactical medic belt stocked with general medications and a defibrillator.
shop-name-armorhd = Armored Kit
