shop-name-belt-mtf-security = Security Tactical Belt
shop-desc-belt-mtf-security = A specialized tactical belt for security personnel. Contains everything necessary for detaining intruders.
shop-name-belt-mtf-grenade = Grenade Belt
shop-desc-belt-mtf-grenade = A load-bearing rig for grenades. Holds 4 fragmentation grenades, 2 high-explosive grenades, 2 smoke grenades, and 2 flashbangs.
shop-name-belt-mtf-construction = Materials Belt
shop-desc-belt-mtf-construction = A specialized belt for storing tools and various materials. Ideal for an engineer.
shop-name-belt-mtf-utility = Utility Belt
shop-desc-belt-mtf-utility = A specialized belt for storing tools. Contains the most advanced tools for a variety of tasks. For the jack-of-all-trades. shop-name-belt-mtf-med-operative = Tactical Medical Belt (Personal)
shop-desc-belt-mtf-med-operative = A specialized tactical belt for a field operative. Contains all the essentials for a frontline fighter: stimulants, sutures, tourniquets, and auto-injectors.
shop-name-belt-mtf-med-medic = Tactical Medical Belt (Medic)
shop-desc-belt-mtf-med-medic = A specialized tactical belt for a field medic. Contains a complete field medic kit—everything needed to provide immediate medical aid: sutures, tissue grafts, medications, and a compact defibrillator.

shop-name-pouch-med-filled = Filled Medical Pouch
shop-desc-pouch-med-filled = A standard medical pouch. Contains a combat medical kit: sutures, a tissue graft, 2 auto-injectors, saline solution, and ephedrine.
shop-name-pouch-explosive-filled = Grenade Pouch (Mixed)
shop-desc-pouch-explosive-filled = A standard grenade pouch. Contains almost every type of grenade: incendiary, fragmentation, stun, flashbang, and 2 smoke grenades.
shop-name-pouch-explosive-nonlethal = Non-Lethal Grenade Pouch
shop-desc-pouch-explosive-nonlethal = A standard grenade pouch. Contains 2 smoke grenades, 2 flashbangs, and 2 stun grenades.
shop-name-pouch-explosive-lethal = Lethal Grenade Pouch
shop-desc-pouch-explosive-lethal = A standard grenade pouch. Contains 2 high-explosive grenades and 4 fragmentation grenades.

